<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Question_about_spell_chains_in_the_UI">Question about spell chains in the UI</span></h2>
<p>Hi Bryan,
</p><p>I have a UI question that hopefully you might still be able to relay...
</p><p>Normally in the skills/spells/talents page, you can use this script fragment to help enumerate through the available spell chains.
</p>
<div dir="ltr" class="mw-geshi mw-code mw-content-ltr"><div class="dascript source-dascript"><pre class="de1">var cid<span class="sy0">:</span>Number <span class="sy0">=</span> Number<span class="br0">&#40;</span>ExternalCommands.<span class="me1">GetValue</span><span class="br0">&#40;</span>'GUI.<span class="me1">SelectedChar</span>.<span class="me1">ID</span>'<span class="br0">&#41;</span><span class="br0">&#41;</span>;
&#160;
